sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant A as Your App
    participant AL as AniList auth server
    participant API as AniList API

    U->>A: Start login
    A->>A: buildAuthorizationUrl(clientId, redirect, state)
    A->>U: Redirect to AniList authorize URL
    U->>AL: Authorize app
    AL->>U: Redirect to callback?code=...&state=...
    U->>A: Arrive at callback
    A->>A: Validate state matches
    A->>AL: getAccessToken(clientId, secret, code, redirect)
    AL->>A: access_token + refresh_token
    A->>API: new AniLink(access_token)
    API->>A: Authenticated data

    Note over A,AL: Token expires (expires_in seconds)
    A->>A: getTokenExpiry(token) < now - 60s?
    A->>AL: refreshAccessToken(clientId, secret, refresh_token)
    AL->>A: New access_token (+ optional refresh_token)
    A->>API: Continue with fresh token